final_image_tex = SubResource("Resource_5a5dv")
blurb = "Depicts a woman fulling cloth. This process involved beating it to clean out the impurities and impart a sheen.

The poem in the top right is by Fujiwara no Masatsune:

[i]Yoshino's
autumn mountain wind
deepens the night.
[lb]In[rb] the cold former capital [lb]of Nara[rb],
cloth is fulled.[/i]

The background shows Genji crests for reasons unclear to me."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://6kpsqyb2pk7a"
